<title>USA: Colonial Downs Q1 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Colonial Downs Q1 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW KENT, Va. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.12     loss	 $0.02</p>
<p> Net profit		   429     loss	    66</p>
<p> Revs			 5,417		    1,305</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,614		    3,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said net profit for 1997 Q1 reflects the full results of two more satellite wagering locations.</p>
<p>The company said it completed its initial public offering in March 1997.</p>
<p>Full name is Colonial Downs Holding Inc.</p>
